From 66167a18e7a82948b93a274fd430df738fcd303f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/45] blitz-dom: Tab passes over a control that is not
 rendered

Tab and Shift+Tab stepped to every focusable element, a hidden one too.
As in browsers, they now pass over an element that is not displayed (or
is in a `display: none` subtree, which Stylo leaves unstyled) or not
visible (`visibility: hidden` or `collapse`), by its resolved styles.
